The <code>ParagraphPdfDocumentReader</code> uses the PDF catalog (e.g. TOC) information to split the input PDF into text paragraphs and output a single <code>Document</code> per paragraph.
NOTE: Not all PDF documents contain the PDF catalog.

Dependencies

Add the dependency to your project using Maven or Gradle.

